of these on here.

38
00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:02.450
<i>Join Us!</i>

39
00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:06.780
<i>Join Us!</i>

40
00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:23.867
Dead bodies in the cellar.

41
00:09:23.893 --> 00:09:26.065
Dead bodies in the cellar.

42
